{
  "name": "sample-notes-api",
  "description": "针对 examples/sample-repo 的 6 道基准题，覆盖入口、鉴权、调用链、越权与测试。每题都要求真实引用，评测脚本会回读校验。",
  "repo": "../examples/sample-repo",
  "defaultMaxToolCalls": 10,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "entry",
      "question": "这个服务的 HTTP 入口在哪里？服务器对象是在哪一行创建的？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/app.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["createServer"],
      "maxToolCalls": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "login-chain",
      "question": "用户登录时密码是怎么校验的？token 又是怎么签发的？请给出调用链。",
      "expectFiles": ["src/auth.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["verifyPassword"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "create-note",
      "question": "创建一条笔记的请求，从路由到写入存储经过哪些函数？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/routes/notes.ts", "src/store.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["handleNotes"],
      "maxToolCalls": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "auth-guard",
      "question": "如果请求没有带 Authorization 头，会得到什么响应？这个判断在哪一行？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/app.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["401"],
      "maxToolCalls": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "ownership",
      "question": "为什么 A 用户读不到 B 用户的笔记？这个约束是在哪一层保证的？",
      "expectFiles": ["src/store.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["ownerId"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "tests",
      "question": "项目里有哪些测试？它们分别验证了什么行为？",
      "expectFiles": ["tests/app.test.ts"],
      "expectKeywords": ["token"],
      "maxToolCalls": 8
    }
  ]
}
